<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian internal security forces have arrested former regime officer Ahmad Raslan, Lieutenant Ahmed Talal Rslan over the al-Ateeba ambush, and a deposed regime officer linked to the al-Otaiba massacre. Two young men were killed by a landmine and another young man died in a war-remnant explosion while herding livestock in the Aleppo countryside. Syria, Jordan, Iraq and Lebanon have signed a pact to bolster food security. Over 23,000 children have been killed during the civil war, according to a monitor, and there were 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSkFVX3lxTE9sMTBaMXc3dHA5Ymo5bTNNMnFmeXY0U1AxZmZseENxS3V2OFMzLU5MMkdpci1IMnRYX0NOclNUWk9lWjN1WjhzSUpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPbVY0NnNsRjJLR2s0TzdfLTBSMDl1UHRmQXdPSkc5RkxyNTJkMDBrM1NrRTRWUUx3UlZIVjRYNlZ5VHVRZ0dnNk9mZVhqM3E4WDZrNkVnZEYyVlJZUDQtZ2R2YWJVTFM4MWxDd210R0FLMUpiVGFuNTJmX2pPM3Q4MXpnZ2RRWWtZOXM2c1VrUHRmVkVfT1ZuSkhKamc3VlRlQW5rOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPcUVjNXZnS19aQmVkMi1TcDlMNUlTUHRPWHNpRkVOLVp2R0xqR3ZHSWpGcVRZWW5haC1NWjNaaldrcHNvNFFfaFNLYXlkZDJJRGZjQ2FtenBqbWhmbXZCaXFxSFFUVndwbDkxWVhoSC1fN0lySjUwaVpVZExqa2NtTG56TzNOUkN6Ti16NnF0TkVoZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBMY3pWN2x5NzFVMXAteWRRVzlJaXNEcGg1VUY5ejE3aDNmQ05MMFJNY0hHNm1NbUxncTMzT3p6dVBadmlVcVUyaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;SyriacPress&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQWHdPZFRuQnM4Z0ZRbmJhNUNuNVNOc2tIcktnZUNEbEkwa3V3NkFwcFNwN0dfY0ktSGZNX0xydVFjcUdBbmZ6bFo3Z3FfRm15MEdwbFpvaWdxc1RaTkUwNmVtX3